1
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:15,930
[Episode 3]

3
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:19,240
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

4
00:01:20,350 --> 00:01:21,680
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

5
00:01:22,710 --> 00:01:23,760
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

6
00:01:26,590 --> 00:01:27,740
[Audition Room]

7
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:27,960
Mr. Zhao.

8
00:01:29,039 --> 00:01:30,070
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

9
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:32,509
I didn't expect to see you here.

10
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,789
Let's call it a day.

11
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,350
Go back and wait for further notice.

12
00:01:40,350 --> 00:01:41,440
Thanks for your hard work.

13
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:45,270
[Audition Room]

14
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:50,880
[Audition Room]

15
00:01:50,789 --> 00:01:52,789
Director Xu, you're still working.

16
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:55,070
The next project has a lot of roles,

17
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:57,170
so it's taking a bit more time.

18
00:01:57,070 --> 00:01:59,180
[Audition Room]

19
00:01:57,660 --> 00:01:59,250
Still casting so late?

20
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,900
The investors are pushing hard. No choice.

21
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,630
I wonder if I have a chance

22
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:06,050
to act in your next project, Director Xu.

23
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:13,870
What role do you want to play, Mr. Zhao?

24
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:15,270
The male lead, of course.

25
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,560
The male lead?

26
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:19,610
The male lead is around 26 or 27.

27
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,850
I'm not sure if you, Mr. Zhao...

28
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,400
Age is not an issue.

29
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:24,650
True.

30
00:02:25,079 --> 00:02:26,680
As long as the acting is good,

31
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,710
age is indeed not an issue.

32
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:31,870
Mr. Zhao.

33
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:35,760
Did you come today just to tell me this?

34
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:39,780
I came just to see you.

35
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,150
See me?

36
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,360
After our conversation yesterday,

37
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,560
I feel you are different
from other directors.

38
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:48,800
Is that so?

39
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:54,300
How am I different?

40
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:57,440
Smarter,

41
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,630
and more attractive.

42
00:03:04,590 --> 00:03:05,400
Director Xu.

43
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:09,190
I feel very comfortable being with you.

44
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,090
Don't you think we are a good match?

45
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,840
Don't you think

46
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,150
we'd be better off

47
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,870
as collaborators?

48
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,680
Xu Jing.

49
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,800
I keep feeling like I've seen you
somewhere before.

50
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:33,360
It's a special feeling.

51
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,420
Lan.

52
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,980
Let's have a baby.

53
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,100
Mr. Zhao.

54
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,510
If there's another scandal
like last night,

55
00:05:15,510 --> 00:05:17,170
won't that be a hassle for you?

56
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:23,540
I get the feeling
you're approaching me on purpose.

57
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,630
It's possible.

58
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:30,630
Everyone approaches someone

59
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,190
for a reason.

60
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:34,290
Having a purpose isn't a bad thing.

61
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:36,820
Otherwise, we would never have met.

62
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,310
Zhao Xiao.

63
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:50,600
Don't think I don't know
where you've been.

64
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,140
I'm pulling my investment
from this project.

65
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:54,670
So you can stop fooling around
behind my back.

66
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,430
Hello. What can I get you?

67
00:06:29,270 --> 00:06:30,560
This one, and this one.

68
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,600
This one, and this one.

69
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,240
Okay.

70
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:04,120
A gift for you.

71
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:05,900
Thank you.

72
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,210
That young man's been coming here
for a week straight.

73
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,670
Mom.

74
00:07:22,690 --> 00:07:24,630
Go, get back to work.

75
00:07:40,190 --> 00:07:41,480
Do you like movies?

76
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:52,920
Hello?

77
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,930
Director Zhao, this is Lan.

78
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,120
My script...

79
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:00,800
Okay.

80
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:01,950
That's fine.

81
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,090
Hello, Ms. Wang.

82
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:09,190
I'm Lan, the screenwriter for "Time".

83
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:10,520
The script I sent you...

84
00:08:18,970 --> 00:08:21,140
[Producer, Juran Pictures]

85
00:08:25,700 --> 00:08:26,750
[Producer, Juran Pictures]

86
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:26,690
Let me help you.

87
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,720
Do you want me to come with you
to the company tomorrow?

88
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,600
It's done?

89
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,200
Thank you, Xiao.

90
00:08:57,290 --> 00:09:00,290
Ms. Du, could you share with us

91
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:02,850
your experience studying acting
in New York?

92
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:05,510
I remember

93
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:08,250
it was at a gala in Cannes.

94
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:11,180
Then the director, across the crowd,

95
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,750
pointed at me and said to his assistant,

96
00:09:12,750 --> 00:09:15,250
"That person is my Eastern Muse."

97
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,570
I was so startled

98
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:19,000
that I spilled champagne
all over my dress.

99
00:09:19,150 --> 00:09:21,440
But looking back now,

100
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:24,000
sometimes what we go through...

101
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,990
Chunqing, your face...

102
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,530
What's wrong with my face?

103
00:09:28,530 --> 00:09:29,530
What's wrong?

104
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,710
What's going on?

105
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,010
Mirror.

106
00:09:40,690 --> 00:09:42,630
If it weren't for Director Xu,

107
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:44,160
do you think I, Du Chunqing,

108
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,620
would act in a short drama?

109
00:09:46,150 --> 00:09:47,600
Go ask around.

110
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,370
How many big film directors

111
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:51,600
are fighting for my schedule right now?

112
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:52,490
I'm sorry.

113
00:09:52,490 --> 00:09:53,200
I forgot.

114
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:54,860
Given your status,

115
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:57,080
you probably don't have access
to that yet.

116
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:57,870
Ms. Du.

117
00:09:58,390 --> 00:10:01,320
I really had no idea about the withdrawal
of investment.

118
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:03,960
It's my honor to work with you
and Director Xu.

119
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,510
Spare me.

120
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:07,150
Instead of wasting your time,

121
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:09,200
you'd be better off
sweet-talking your wife.

122
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,000
A short drama is such a small project.

123
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,760
I could find anyone to carry it.

124
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:15,000
I asked you to invest as a favor,

125
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,010
to give you a shot.

126
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:17,320
It doesn't matter if you don't invest.

127
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:21,060
But the one replaced
will never be Director Xu.

128
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:22,870
It'll be...

129
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:23,760
Ms. Du.

130
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:26,590
I understand the situation you mentioned.

131
00:10:26,590 --> 00:10:29,000
I'll resolve the investment withdrawal
as soon as possible.

132
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,030
I still hope

133
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:31,750
to see you and Director Xu on set.

134
00:10:31,750 --> 00:10:34,080
Our project will definitely go smoothly.

135
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:50,870
No sense of propriety.

136
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,600
With a wife like that,

137
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,180
he deserves to go nowhere.

138
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,240
Thank you for doing me a huge favor,
Ms. Du.

139
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,240
Don't mention it.

140
00:10:58,550 --> 00:10:59,630
You introduced me

141
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:01,360
to a top expert like Dr. Fang.

142
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,200
It's a win-win for both of us.

143
00:11:05,630 --> 00:11:06,840
Aside from the slight loss of elasticity

144
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,600
in the upper eyelid
and cheek hollow areas,

145
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,000
everything else is fine.

146
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:11,630
The surgical plan

147
00:11:11,630 --> 00:11:13,320
just needs some targeted adjustments.

148
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,520
You can rest assured.

149
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:16,120
With you performing the surgery
personally,

150
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,580
I'm definitely relieved.

151
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,870
Get some rest first.

152
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:21,000
A nurse will come shortly
to run some tests.

153
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,150
Then you'll be all finished.

154
00:11:22,150 --> 00:11:24,310
I'll check my schedule.

155
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,510
Then we can book a time for the surgery.

156
00:11:26,510 --> 00:11:27,840
This is my phone number.

157
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:30,280
Once you've decided, just tell Ms. Xu.

158
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,130
She knows the process well.

159
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,330
Ms. Xu,

160
00:11:36,790 --> 00:11:38,790
could I have a word with you outside?

161
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:40,080
Give me a second.

162
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,450
What is it, Dr. Fang?

163
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,270
The hospital just received
a new medication.

164
00:11:54,270 --> 00:11:55,910
It's more effective
for treating your allergic reaction

165
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:56,910
to the skin graft.

166
00:11:56,910 --> 00:11:57,840
Give it a try.

167
00:11:58,870 --> 00:11:59,470
By the way,

168
00:11:59,550 --> 00:12:00,550
isn't it time for the next phase

169
00:12:00,550 --> 00:12:02,000
of your daily medication?

170
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,240
Wait for me here.

171
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:04,860
I'll go get them for you.

172
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,910
Make sure to take them on time.

173
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:08,080
Thank you, Dr. Fang.

174
00:12:08,670 --> 00:12:10,750
I've kept all the prescriptions
you gave me before.

175
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:12,810
I can get them at the pharmacy myself.

176
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,630
I can't keep bothering you.

177
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,040
It's no bother at all.

178
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,540
As your doctor,

179
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:20,160
I naturally need to keep track
of your health.

180
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:24,870
Besides,

181
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,740
being needed by you...

182
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,330
makes me very happy.

183
00:12:43,730 --> 00:12:47,590
[Beauty Power Gala]

184
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:23,040
Mr. Zhao,
Dr. Qi is already waiting for you.

185
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,320
Okay.

186
00:13:46,370 --> 00:13:47,250
Director Xu.

187
00:13:49,110 --> 00:13:49,980
What a coincidence.
